cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or its measurements, cite this research artifact and
  the upstream model, benchmarks, and runtimes credited in the methodology.
title: Weight Space Lab
abstract: >-
  Exploratory direct weight-editing experiments on Qwen3.5-0.8B, with
  instruction-following evaluation in WebLLM and separately measured browser
  resource comparisons. The artifact preserves negative and inconclusive
  results, experiment provenance, execution limits, and measurement scope.
